        "original_id": "e1437973-c686-5d43-a77f-9d6d31300fba",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Bombardier, Learjet, Lear Siegler\n- People: William Powell Lear\n- Products: business jets, military jets, 8-track tape system\n- Topics: founders, inventions\n\nFacts:\n- Learjet is an American manufacturer of business jets for civilian and military use.\n- Learjet was founded by William Powell Lear.\n- Bombardier is the Canadian owner of Learjet.\n- William Powell Lear did not develop the 8-track portable tape system.\n- The 8-track tape system was developed by the Lear Siegler company, not by William Powell Lear personally.",
