        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Learjet\n- People: Bill Lear\n- Places: Wichita, Kansas\n- Products: business jets, battery eliminator, 8-track cartridge\n- Topics: civilian and military aviation, audio tape systems\n\nFacts:\n- Learjet is a Canadian-owned American manufacturer of business jets for civilian and military use based in Wichita, Kansas.\n- Bill Lear invented the battery eliminator for the B battery.\n- Bill Lear developed the 8-track cartridge, which is an audio tape system.",
